BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BraVESTimo! Dementia and Community Chorus
DTSTART:20261118T183000Z
DTEND:20261118T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T154648Z
UID:df70f963ad217089b3237d1ba21b6b895ca19aaf@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Causes,Community
DESCRIPTION:Event by VEST - Vocal Essence of the Southern Tier and The Par
 k Church Elmira\nThe Park Church Elmira\nPublic\nSinging is good for the b
 rain—and even better when we experience it together!\nBraVESTimo! is a j
 oyful community chorus for people living with dementia\, Parkinson’s dis
 ease\, or other neurodegenerative conditions\, their care partners\, and c
 ommunity members who simply love to sing.\nYou do not need to have a perso
 nal connection to dementia to participate. Community singers are warmly in
 vited to sing alongside our members—adding friendship\, encouragement\, 
 musical support\, and shared joy.\nResearch suggests that group singing ca
 n support mood\, meaningful engagement\, emotional well-being\, and social
  connection for people living with dementia and their care partners.\nThis
  is not a choir performing for people living with dementia. It is a commun
 ity singing with one another.\nNo prior singing experience is needed. All 
 voices are welcome.\nLearn more and register at www.vestny.org.\nWe offer 
 barrier-free access with a Pay-What-You-Are-Able Model\n#BraVESTimo #Commu
 nitySinging #DementiaSupport #CarePartners #BrainHealth #MusicAndMemory #V
 ESTNY\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/785
 14637/20261118133000
GEO:42.089201;-76.808797
LOCATION:Park Church\, 208 West Gray Street\, Elmira\, New York\, 14901\, 
 United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514637/20261118133000
END:VEVENT
