 uite 102\, Elmira\, NY\nPublic\nSmall Business Saturday is almost here\, a
 nd we’re kicking it off with something brand new downtown!\nOn Saturday
 \, November 28\, come discover your Elmira this holiday season. The first 
 250 people to stop by the Elmira Downtown Development office at 231 W Wate
 r Street\, Suite 102\, from 11am to 1pm will receive a free Elmira Downtow
 n Holiday Shopping Bag in red and black houndstooth\, packed with mystery 
 prizes\, deals from local businesses\, and a chance to win gift cards to y
 our favorite local spots.\nWant a shot at a $100 gift card to spend locall
 y? Enter the sweepstakes for free at https://www.zeffy.com/.../small-busin
 ess-saturday-elmira.... Entries open October 19 and close at 11:59 PM on N
 ovember 23\, with the winner drawn November 24. Entering does not reserve 
 a shopping bag\, so you’ll need to come downtown on November 28 to pick 
 one up.\nThis event is made possible by our presenting sponsor\, Hilliard
 \, along with Chemung Supply Corporation\, Pudgie’s Pizza and Subs\, Sie
 mens Energy\, and Patrick’s. Thank you for supporting downtown Elmira!\n
 Shop local\, support your neighbors\, and let’s make this holiday season
  a good one downtown.\nelmiradowntown.com\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https:/
 /calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78514613/20261128110000
