BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Winterfare 2026 in Elmira
DTSTART:20261211T210000Z
DTEND:20261212T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T154648Z
UID:aeb9b89d2536dbd469fc684e78d21242dae9327b@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Holidays,Community,Family Fun,New to the Area
DESCRIPTION:Elmira Downtown Development is thrilled to announce Winterfare
  2026\, a holiday event designed to transform downtown Elmira into a magic
 al winter destination.\nTaking place Friday\, December 11 (4–8 PM) and S
 aturday\, December 12 (11–5 PM) at Wisner Park\, this thoughtfully curat
 ed market draws inspiration from traditional German Christmas markets and 
 the iconic Bryant Park Winter Village in New York City. Winterfare is an i
 mmersive experience crafted to bring the community together in a fresh and
  meaningful way.\nGuests can expect:\nA cozy\, European-style market atmos
 phere with artisan shopping\, festive lighting\, and holiday decor\nLive e
 ntertainment throughout the weekend\, including fire spinning\, music\, an
 d caroling\, presented by The Dunn Group\nDelicious seasonal food and warm
  drinks from local vendors and food trucks\nThe return of the Snow Globe E
 xperience\, in partnership with Rye Bar include 45 minutes in a private do
 me for up to six guests\, featuring curated charcuterie boards and wine pa
 irings (reservations required). Sponsored by Hilliard\, The Dunn Group\, C
 hemung Supply Corporation\, and Kennedy Valve\nMeet & Greet with Santa bot
